---
---
<!-- PROJECTS SECTION -->
<section id="projects" class="reveal-section content-section px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 py-20 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <span class="section-index">04 · Portofolio</span>
                <h2>Proyek Pilihan</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Tiga proyek pilihan untuk memperlihatkan eksplorasi dan karya saya.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="project-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
            <!-- Project 1 -->
            <article class="project-card flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="project-image">
                    <img src="/images/Website E Commerce.png" alt="Tampilan halaman utama toko buah dengan katalog produk" loading="lazy">
                </div>
                <div class="project-content p-6 flex flex-col justify-between flex-1">
                    <div>
                        <div class="project-tags flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3.5">
                            <span class="tag-accent">Tailwind CSS</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">JavaScript</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">Responsive</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="project-title text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-2.5 transition">
                            Website E-Commerce Toko Buah
                        </h3>
                        <p class="project-desc text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Halaman toko buah dengan katalog produk, navigasi kategori, dan area promosi untuk pengalaman belanja online yang nyaman.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-footer flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="project-preview-pending">Live Preview segera hadir</span>
                        <a href="https://github.com/rayhanmaulana0203-sketch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="project-action-primary">
                            <span>Lihat GitHub</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Project 2 -->
            <article class="project-card flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="project-image">
                    <img src="/images/math-ceria-preview.png" alt="Pratinjau website Math Ceria untuk belajar matematika dengan cara menyenangkan" loading="lazy">
                </div>
                <div class="project-content p-6 flex flex-col justify-between flex-1">
                    <div>
                        <div class="project-tags flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3.5">
                            <span class="tag-accent">Edukasi</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">Matematika</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">Web Interaktif</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="project-title text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-2.5 transition">
                            Math Ceria: Belajar Matematika
                        </h3>
                        <p class="project-desc text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Website edukasi yang mengajak siswa belajar matematika dengan suasana menyenangkan, dilengkapi navigasi materi interaktif.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-footer flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="project-preview-pending">Konsep proyek cadangan</span>
                        <a href="https://github.com/rayhanmaulana0203-sketch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="project-action-primary">
                            <span>Lihat GitHub</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Project 3 -->
            <article class="project-card flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="project-image project-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="placeholder-graphic">
                        <i data-lucide="compass" class="w-12 h-12"></i>
                        <span>Konsep Eksplorasi</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-content p-6 flex flex-col justify-between flex-1">
                    <div>
                        <div class="project-tags flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3.5">
                            <span class="tag-accent">JavaScript</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">Responsive</span>
                            <span class="tag-muted">Eksplorasi</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="project-title text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-2.5 transition">
                            Website Panduan Wisata
                        </h3>
                        <p class="project-desc text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Konsep website panduan destinasi wisata dengan informasi tempat, rekomendasi aktivitas, dan tampilan ramah perangkat seluler.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-footer flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="project-preview-pending">Konsep eksplorasi</span>
                        <a href="https://github.com/rayhanmaulana0203-sketch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="project-action-primary">
                            <span>Lihat GitHub</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
